{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36689","headline":"送进士臧濆下第後归池州 · 罗隐","name":"送进士臧濆下第後归池州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赋成无处换黄金，却向春风动越吟。\n天子爱才虽仄席，诸生多病又沾襟。\n柳攀灞岸狂遮袂，水忆池阳渌满心。\n珍重彩衣归正好，莫将闲事系升沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36689.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36689","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}